ails": null}, "order": 1, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "EDITOR", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 161930564, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": true, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": "<h2 style=\"text-align:start;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-family: Chaloops-Medium;\">How to play:</span></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">Player 1 says they are going on a journey to a place beginning with A, e.g. “I am going to Amsterdam.”</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">Player 2 asks what they are doing there: “What will you do in Amsterdam?”</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">Player 1 replies with a</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(242,141,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">{{definition \"verb\" \"Also known as a doing word.\"}}</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">,</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(155,197,61);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">{{definition \"adjective\" \"Used to describe a noun.\"}}</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">and</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(57,176,226);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">{{definition \"noun\" \"The name of something.\"}}</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">(beginning with A) to say what they are doing, e.g. “I will</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(242,141,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">adopt</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(155,197,61);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">amazing</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(57,176,226);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">aardvarks</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">.”</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">Player 2 then thinks of a place beginning with B, e.g. “I am going to Birmingham.”</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">Player 1 asks: “What will you do in Birmingham?”</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">Player 2 replies with a</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(242,141,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">{{definition \"verb\" \"Also known as a doing word.\"}}</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">,</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(155,197,61);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">{{definition \"adjective\" \"Used to describe a noun.\"}}</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">and</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(57,176,226);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">{{definition \"noun\" \"The name of something.\"}}</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">(beginning with B). e.g. “I will</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(242,141,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">bake</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(155,197,61);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">boring</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(57,176,226);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">biscuits</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">.”</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">Keep taking it in turns with all the letters of the alphabet up to Z.</span>&nbsp;</li>\n</ol>\n<p style=\"text-align:start;\"><br>&nbsp;</p>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 161930656, "text": null, "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 1, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "EDITOR", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 161930564, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": true, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": "<h2 style=\"text-align:start;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-family: Ch